{"title": "第二十六章", "index": 1535, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"J0E6S0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">重为轻根，静为躁君。是以圣人终日行而不离辎重，虽有荣观，燕处超然。奈何万乘之主，而以身轻天下？轻则失本，躁则失君。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}